### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Login como ADMIN (puede leer y ejecutar simulaciones)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Login como VIEWER (solo lectura)
# @name loginViewer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "viewer",
  "password": "Viewer123!"
}

### Listar todos los dispositivos (requiere Authorization: Bearer <token> de cualquiera de los logins de arriba)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Listar dispositivos filtrados por tipo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices?type=FIREWALL
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Detalle de un dispositivo (reemplaza el id por uno real devuelto arriba)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Simular ejecución de script (requiere rol ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scripts/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{
  "deviceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "scriptName": "backup-config",
  "parameters": "--dry-run"
}

### Simular con rol VIEWER -> debe responder 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scripts/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginViewer.response.body.token}}

{
  "deviceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "scriptName": "backup-config",
  "parameters": "--dry-run"
}

### Historial de simulaciones (incluye performedBy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scripts/simulate/history
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Swagger / OpenAPI (sin autenticación)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs
